    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Availability Group health",
      "description": "Explains why AG / HADR health is not shown and what would be needed.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The SQL Server exporter deployed on CCX nodes does **not** expose Always On Availability Group health: no `mssql_*` series for AG, HADR, replica or synchronization state exist in VictoriaMetrics, so replica role, synchronization state, send/redo queue and failover readiness cannot be graphed here.\n\nTo add it, extend the exporter with custom queries over the HADR DMVs, for example:\n\n- `sys.dm_hadr_availability_replica_states` (role, connected_state, synchronization_health)\n- `sys.dm_hadr_database_replica_states` (synchronization_state, log_send_queue_size, redo_queue_size, last_commit_time for estimated data loss)\n- `sys.availability_groups` / `sys.availability_replicas` (AG and replica names, availability mode)\n\nUntil then, the table on the right shows which datastores are AG-based (`mssql_ao_*` cluster type) and whether every replica's exporter is up."
      },
      "id": 25,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "AG datastores",
      "description": "SQL Server datastores in the selection with their CCX cluster type and how many replicas report up.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count by (DatastoreName, ClusterType) (mssql_up{job=~\"cmon-sd.*\",environment=~\"$environment\",ClusterName=~\"$datastore\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (DatastoreName, ClusterType) (mssql_up{job=~\"cmon-sd.*\",environment=~\"$environment\",ClusterName=~\"$datastore\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
